  "title": "Oven-Baked Beef Stroganoff",
  "description": "This oven beef stroganoff recipe bakes top round steak under a rich, beefy broth featuring red wine, mushrooms, and onions.",
  "authors": [
    "Sylvia Arrowood"
  ],
